text = "WASD  move
Mouse  look
E / Q  grow / shrink
Shift / Right Mouse  extend arms
Click / F  grab, set down (tap), throw (hold)
R  stow held item / take out equipped item
Tab  cycle equipped slot    V / Middle Mouse  use it
C  open your dock (when next to it)
Space  next line    Backspace  skip    T  auto-advance
Esc  free the mouse"

